sy","sv":"Höst","en":"Autumn"}},"koulutuksenAlkamisvuosi":"2027","henkilokohtaisenSuunnitelmanLisatiedot":{}},"isMuokkaajaOphVirkailija":false},"formatoituModified":{"fi":"8.9.2026 klo 14:45","sv":"8.9.2026 kl. 14:45","en":"Sep. 8, 2026 at 02:45 PM UTC+3"}}],"koulutustyyppiPath":"kk/yo","timestamp":1794924799887,"organisaatio":{"paikkakunta":{"koodiUri":"kunta_405","nimi":{"fi":"Lappeenranta","sv":"Villmanstrand"}},"nimi":{"fi":"Lappeenrannan-Lahden teknillinen yliopisto LUT","sv":"Lappeenrannan-Lahden teknillinen yliopisto LUT","en":"Lappeenranta-Lahti University of Technology LUT"},"oid":"1.2.246.562.10.42777795784"},"metadata":{"luokittelutermit":[],"kuvaus":{"en":"<p>Your studies in this programme will focus on theoretical knowledge and technical skills in relevant business analytics methods, including data analytics, modelling, simulation, and multiple-criteria decision-making and evaluation methods and their practical use on real-world data in a real-world business or industry context. The software and tools applied during the course are standard in the industry.</p><p></p><p>The need for analytics is growing due to the abundance of data available. Business analytics includes quantitative and statistical analysis, machine learning, multivariate testing, predictive modelling, and multiple-criteria evaluation and decision support. It uses data to evaluate past performances and to draw up plans for the future. As a graduate from this programme, you will be in high demand and have access to interesting positions in business and industry.</p>"},"osaamistavoitteet":{"en":"<p>As a graduate, you will be a competent business analytics professional who knows and can critically analyse the theories and methods in the field.</p><p></p><p>During the programme, you will acquire:<br>- professional skills to critically analyse the theories and methods in this field; you will be able to choose the correct business analytics methods and use them in practice to draw logical conclusions and make recommendations in strategic decision-making situations;<br><strong>- </strong>competence<strong> </strong>in applied business research; you will be able to draw justified conclusions and analytically discuss the implications of research results;<br><strong>- </strong>responsible business skills to critically evaluate consequences of business decisions from a responsibility perspective.</p><p></p>"},"opintojenLaajuusyksikko":{"koodiUri":"opintojenlaajuusyksikko_2#1","nimi":{"fi":"opintopistettä","sv":"studiepoäng","en":"ECTS credits"}},"koulutusala":[{"koodiUri":"kansallinenkoulutusluokitus2016koulutusalataso2_041#1","nimi":{"fi":"Kauppa ja hallinto","sv":"Handel och administration","en":"Business and administration"}}],"opintojenLaajuusNumero":120.0,"isMuokkaajaOphVirkailija":false,"lisatiedot":[{"otsikko":{"koodiUri":"koulutuksenlisatiedot_04#1","nimi":{"fi":"Uramahdollisuudet","sv":"Karriärmöjligheter","en":"Career opportunities"}},"teksti":{"en":"<p>As a graduate, you will be a perfect fit for the business development and business analytics teams of global corporations and small and medium-sized enterprises (SMEs).</p><p></p><p>Hands-on skills in business analytics are in very high demand globally – there is a great shortage of business analytics professionals on the market. The programme is practical and career-oriented and gives you a unique multi-disciplinary education in technology and business, which is highly valued in the corporate world and industry.</p><p></p><p>You will be prepared for a career in business analytics and analytical business development as an analytics professional in an industrial or service company or as a consultant.</p><p></p><p>Entrepreneurship is also a realistic possibility with the pragmatic skill set you will acquire.</p>"}},{"otsikko":{"koodiUri":"koulutuksenlisatiedot_12#1","nimi":{"fi":"Sisältö","sv":"Innehåll","en":"Content"}},"teksti":{"en":"<p>Your studies in this programme will focus on theoretical knowledge and technical skills in relevant business analytics methods.</p><p></p><p>These methods include data analytics, modelling, simulation, and multiple-criteria decision-making and evaluation methods and their practical use on real-world data in a real-world business or industry context.</p><p></p><p>The software and tools applied during the course are standard in the industry. In this programme, we aim to provide business intelligence, insights into business and industry processes, and advanced managerial decision support.</p><p><a href=\"https://www.lut.fi/en/studies/business/masters-programme-business-analytics\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Read more about the programme</a></p>"}},{"otsikko":{"koodiUri":"koulutuksenlisatiedot_01#1","nimi":{"fi":"Opintojen rakenne","sv":"Studiernas uppbyggnad","en":"Structure of studies"}},"teksti":{"en":"<p>The Master's Programme in Business Analytics is a two-year programme leading to the degree of Master of Science in Economics and Business Administration, M.Sc. (Econ. &amp; Bus. Adm.). It is 120 ECTS credits and includes core, advanced specialisation and language studies as well as a master's thesis. Read more in <a href=\"https://forms.lut.fi/opinto-opas/Tutkinto.aspx?id=otm-dcd74656-fb50-48fe-8e55-7e1a047d6c3e&amp;period=lut-curriculum-period-2026-2027&amp;lang=en-US\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">this academic year's curriculum</a>.</p><p></p>"}},{"otsikko":{"koodiUri":"koulutuksenlisatiedot_11#1","nimi":{"fi":"Opinnäytetyö","sv":"Lärdomsprov","en":"Thesis"}},"teksti":{"en":"<p>The master's thesis, 30 ECTS credits, is an advanced research project completed during the fourth semester. It requires approximately six months of full-time work.</p>"}},{"otsikko":{"koodiUri":"koulutuksenlisatiedot_02#1","nimi":{"fi":"Jatko-opintomahdollisuudet","sv":"Möjlighet till fortsatta studier","en":"Further study opportunities"}},"teksti":{"en":"<p>LUT’s Master of Science in Economics and Business Administration degree prepares students also for post graduate studies (Doctor of Science in Economics and Business Administration).</p><p></p><p>For more information, visit&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.lut.fi/en/research/doctoral-school\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">LUT Doctoral School</a>.</p>"}}],"tyyppi":"yo","tutkintonimike":[{"koodiUri":"tutkintonimikekk_231#2","nimi":{"fi":"Kauppatieteiden maisteri","sv":"Ekonomie magister","en":"Master of Science (Economics and Business Administration)"}}]},"formatoituModified":{"fi":"2.9.2026 klo 11:13","sv":"2.9.2026 kl. 11:13","en":"Sep. 2, 2026 at 11:13 AM UTC+3"},"koulutustyyppi":"yo"}